  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Mond process for metal refining: In this process, nickel is heated in a stream of carbon monoxide forming a volatile complex, nickel tetracarbonyl:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ni</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>CO</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mn>330</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>350</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Ni</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>CO</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>4</mn></msub></math></p><p>The carbonyl is subjected to a higher temperature so that it is decomposed giving the pure metal:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ni</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>CO</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mn>450</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>470</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Ni</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>CO</mi></math></p>",
